OL,3,GNEWSAComparison of station to 'death
OL,4,Acamp' condemned
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Liverpool councillors have been
OL,7,Fcriticised after comparing crowd
OL,8,Fcontrol measures at a train station to
OL,9,Fmethods used in Nazi concentration
OL,10,Fcamps.
OL,12,FLiberal Democrats Pat Maloney and
OL,13,FRichard Kemp were responding to planned
OL,14,Fchanges to Sandhills station near
OL,15,FEverton's Hill Dickinson stadium, which
OL,16,Fwould supporters go through "corralling
OL,17,Fareas" and "sterile zones".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
