OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1787810179
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAComparison of station to 'death
OL,4,Acamp' condemned
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaloney told a Liverpool Council
OL,7,Fplanning meeting the scheme was "like
OL,8,Fsomething out of a horrific death camp
OL,9,Fin Nazi Germany" while Kemp likened it
OL,10,Fto "a greeting area at Auschwitz".
OL,12,FBoth councillors have since apologised
OL,13,Ffor any offence caused by the comments,
OL,14,Fwhich were described as "appalling" by
OL,15,Flocal Jewish community leaders.
